{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7e7da7da9d5f1712c7948a3a684550988066e5524f1ad04ba272043f2796e77a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fe2fddfa99cdfc49cb16e647f6d93caab1a8771329dacb04dd3577161988514",
      "text": "身为派对主角的自觉",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37cdbdefe8e2604dde8471a146b65aedda691eadfe6a4c77680121c067116d65",
      "text": "对自己的生日并不怎么上心的恭二。\n恭二以两人工作繁忙为由想要推掉派对，\n实和皮埃尔努力劝说他，\n并抽空在工作间隙筹备派对，然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f19f38080059bce8e9464f233021d4a059efae1f6938f77b0db7efd08839689",
      "text": "确认完毕！\n装饰，搞定。礼物，搞定！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53665d30ef84c52e6b3196a6f6d7c8ad2580306f56187d12d8aee07831dd1054",
      "text": "蛋糕和料理也都安排好了。花束做得也很棒，\n派对的准备工作完美无缺呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c86273e47515c20e747b06d82df8b5084299e0f2324c3f137dffd336581dcfcd",
      "text": "恭二会开心吗？\n我好兴奋啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4380dcc29c5dfa552dafbd3958edf075a7b710b902af79663f898657238ffa3f",
      "text": "没问题的。\n他绝对会开心的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4325de6f3c005db9474926a8a202537b41b78425c5764e82f164c354f60924c8",
      "text": "青蛙君，也要参加恭二的派对！\n呱呱呱～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8015c62e1c762c6fa5a34f66e71cb577a2652249e37a4b42aba82553f0edeeb",
      "text": "呵呵，为了能让恭二尽情享受，\n我们要全力炒热气氛哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08ea1623ce6dd30e02fd4e34aca8ff5709d42cc6a371927ea06efebe76662173",
      "text": "话虽如此，休息室居然能\n变成这副模样啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:060cb51c2de127dd5baafc3ce4695ff6dd2e37a5b9a026776350587853131010",
      "text": "这些装饰也是皮埃尔你们做的吗？\n手艺真巧啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c857d465be0978ac58fd75709a3b6de8d8d5cba0b4786f204234c3695a281e8",
      "text": "嗯，我很努力了哦！\n想了好多什么样的装饰恭二会喜欢呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eee3ed57a266fc582bb22117be77a957b3d171c2cc2eb43bb703e09a40996c08",
      "text": "制作人也在做装饰、出主意方面……\n帮了好多忙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7818c968e1bc4e3c48b5c9eed6c899eef9b4ca77b1e13ba6016be1f5e9cb09aa",
      "text": "也要感谢制作人呢。\n多亏了大家，我真的迎来了一个很棒的生日。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40df3af54faf542e8e2683169a42b6eb398cd684ae25347a9b2fd151158d4b23",
      "text": "这个花束，是实先生帮我做的吧。\n怎么说呢，真厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:337ae76767cb34244dbad965215727833c31d66de08dcadd116b47fd35cb9247",
      "text": "用了恭二的生日花哦。\n对我来说这也是自信之作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad7365ee916adb76cfaffc878f95701fd7a42f03b93398ff84460dbbda703d4b",
      "text": "颜色和形状的平衡也是呢，\n为了能衬托出恭二的气质，花了不少心思哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:447cf28c6615df39b96423c37c64b21b556f2bdffc6778349381e94161642ce1",
      "text": "实先生你们明明也很忙，却为了我\n做到这种地步……真的非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_009kyj_2_1_2_009_12:1_2_009_12_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63290d166c769ea9d3a44dda8958e37600f79168b217535331e6b31501a55048",
      "text": "这点小事算不了什么啦。\n我才要谢谢你带给我们这么开心的时光呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
